WEBVTT

00:09:29.648 --> 00:09:33.402
the specific needs of the other
half of the population

00:09:33.402 --> 00:09:35.112
were taken into account.

00:09:36.530 --> 00:09:39.325
Now, what does Vienna's story tell us?

00:09:39.867 --> 00:09:45.456
It tells us that if we want women
to benefit from a green city project,

00:09:45.497 --> 00:09:50.085
from an urbanism project,
or from any project,

00:09:50.085 --> 00:09:51.962
it needs intention.

00:09:53.005 --> 00:09:57.009
And intention means
at least these three ingredients:

00:09:58.093 --> 00:10:01.513
upfront and ascending
women specific needs,